    <string name="anatomy_desc_core">The trunk muscles support posture and help transfer force between the upper and lower body.</string>
    <string name="anatomy_desc_chest">The pectoral muscles contribute to pushing movements and work with the shoulders and triceps.</string>
    <string name="anatomy_desc_back">Back muscles support the trunk and contribute to pulling movements and shoulder control.</string>
    <string name="anatomy_desc_legs">The glutes, quadriceps and calves work together in squats, steps and many lower-body movements.</string>
    <string name="anatomy_desc_arms">The upper arms and forearms assist with pushing, pulling, carrying and grip-related movements.</string>
